{
  "spec": "aadistill.artifact_spec/v1",
  "session": "autoinit_phase_a",
  "note": "success spec for a Phase-A run that reached ALL_DONE. The permanent products are the search trace, the per-probe journal and the selection records. min_matches on the probe journal is 9 (rung 1's 6 + rung 2's 3); the conditional seed-sc rung adds up to 3 more and is NOT required, because a run that resolved after two seeds correctly never produced them. Entries are ArtifactSpec kwargs \u2014 artifact_class, pattern, required, min_matches, min_bytes, lifecycle.",
